"From now on it can browse, preview and save copies of everything in your home folder and on connected drives that macOS lets MeowDisplay read — without asking again, until you change it in Settings ▸ Devices. ~/Library, other users' files and protected locations stay out of reach, and macOS may still ask you before MeowDisplay reads Desktop, Documents, Downloads or a drive. It can't change or delete anything unless you allow that separately." = "此后，设备可浏览、预览并存储个人文件夹及已连接驱动器中 macOS 允许 ExtendPad 读取的所有内容副本，直到你在“设置 ▸ 设备”中更改，无需再次询问。~/Library、其他用户的文件和受保护位置仍不可访问；读取桌面、文稿、下载或驱动器前，macOS 仍可能询问。除非你单独允许，设备不能更改或删除任何内容。";
