"What you copy here can be pasted there, and the other way round, as set in Settings ▸ Clipboard. Copies can contain passwords or private messages; MeowDisplay skips items that apps mark as private, but can't recognize every one. Clipboard sharing never gives control of this Mac or access to its files." = "按照“设置 ▸ 剪贴板”中的设置，可在此处拷贝并粘贴到另一端，也可反向粘贴。拷贝内容可能包含密码或私人消息；ExtendPad 会跳过应用标记为私密的项目，但无法保证识别所有私密内容。剪贴板共享绝不会授予此 Mac 的控制权或文件访问权限。";
"When several people are logged in to this Mac at once, devices list this Mac once, with each person's session under it. Each session pairs on its own, and a session that's switched out shows as unavailable." = "多人同时登录此 Mac 时，设备只列出此 Mac 一次，并在其下显示各用户会话。每个会话独立配对；已切换出去的会话显示为不可用。";
"While a device is connected, this Mac's own screens are covered in black; the device still sees and controls everything. Remote means Tailscale and other routed addresses; local means Wi-Fi, peer-to-peer, USB and hotspot. Someone at the Mac can remove it with Touch ID (when this Mac has it and it's allowed above) or this Mac's login password, typed on its own keyboard; it covers again after the time above without use at the Mac. It doesn't stop typing or clicking at the Mac, and some system alerts can appear above it. Its message moves every minute and fades when no one is at the Mac, so OLED screens don't burn in." = "设备连接期间，此 Mac 自己的屏幕会被黑色遮蔽，设备仍可查看和控制所有内容。“远程”指 Tailscale 及其他路由地址；“本地”指 Wi-Fi、点对点、USB 和热点。Mac 前的用户可使用触控 ID（此 Mac 支持且上方已允许）或在 Mac 自带键盘上输入登录密码来移除遮蔽；上方设定的时间内未操作 Mac 后会再次遮蔽。它不会阻止在 Mac 上键入或点按，部分系统提醒可能显示在遮蔽层上方。提示文字每分钟移动，无人在 Mac 前时变淡，以避免 OLED 屏幕烧屏。";
"Works only while Unified Clipboard is on in Settings ▸ Clipboard and the device turned it on too. Clipboard access never gives control of this Mac or access to its files." = "仅在“设置 ▸ 剪贴板”中的通用剪贴板已开启且设备也已开启时可用。剪贴板访问权限绝不会授予此 Mac 的控制权或文件访问权限。";
"Your Session's Name" = "你的会话名称";
"macOS asks before an app reads what you copied in another app. Choose Allow for MeowDisplay in System Settings ▸ Privacy & Security ▸ Paste from Other Apps so copies reach your devices without asking each time. Copies from your devices arrive either way." = "应用读取你在其他应用中拷贝的内容前，macOS 会询问。请在“系统设置 ▸ 隐私与安全性 ▸ 从其他 App 粘贴”中允许 ExtendPad，使内容无需每次询问即可到达设备。无论此设置如何，来自设备的内容都可到达。";
"macOS lets apps change Stage Manager only through Shortcuts. Set Up Automatically prepares these two shortcuts and opens them in Shortcuts, which asks you to Add Shortcut for each; nothing is added without that click. MeowDisplay runs them only when you allow it. To make them yourself instead:" = "macOS 只允许应用通过“快捷指令”更改台前调度。“自动设置”会准备并打开这两个快捷指令，你需要分别点按“添加快捷指令”；未点按前不会添加任何内容。ExtendPad 仅在你允许时运行它们。也可手动创建：";
"macOS pauses windows in Stage Manager's side strip, so a device sees their last picture until they're on the Mac's stage. Windows on the current stage always stream. A device with control can show one on the Mac, or, once set up, turn Stage Manager off for Window mode after you confirm there." = "macOS 会暂停台前调度侧边栏中的窗口，因此设备只能看到其最后的画面，直到窗口进入 Mac 舞台。当前舞台上的窗口始终会串流。拥有控制权限的设备可在 Mac 上显示窗口；完成设置后，也可经你在 Mac 上确认，在窗口模式下关闭台前调度。";
